  },
  {
    "id": 7016001030010,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "……そう、ですか",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701600103/7016001030010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……もしかして、嬉しくないのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7016001030020,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "あっ……いえっ、そんなことありません！\r\nすごく、嬉しいです",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701600103/7016001030020"
  },
  {
    "id": 7016001030030,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "でも……もっとちゃんと\r\n自分のことを考えなくちゃと思ったんです",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701600103/7016001030030",
    "charAnim3Loop": false
  },
  {
    "id": 7016001030040,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "ここまで来させてもらえたのは、\r\nご縁とか、運とか……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701600103/7016001030040"
  },
  {
    "id": 7016001030050,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "私を想ってくださる、\r\nいろんな方々の想いのおかげだなって思います",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701600103/7016001030050"
  },
  {
    "id": 7016001030060,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "でも、ここから先は違います",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701600103/7016001030060"
  },
  {
    "id": 7016001030070,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "私、ちゃんとしなきゃ、\r\nまたご迷惑をお掛けすることになっちゃいます",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701600103/7016001030070",
    "charAnim3Loop": false
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "迷惑なんてことはないよ\r\n少なくとも俺は、そんなふうに思ったことはない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7016001030080,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん……\r\nふふ、ありがとうございます",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701600103/7016001030080"
  },
  {
    "id": 7016001030090,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "でも、プロデューサーさんの言葉に\r\n甘えるわけにはいきません",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701600103/7016001030090"
  },
  {
    "id": 7016001030100,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "こういう結果を頂いたからこそ……\r\nちゃんと自分と向き合わないと駄目なんです",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701600103/7016001030100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まだ、答えは出てないんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7016001030110,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "はい\r\n……すみません、プロデューサーさん",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701600103/7016001030110",
    "charAnim3Loop": false
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、謝ることじゃないよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "急いで考えることはない\r\n千雪の答えが出るまでいつまでも待つよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7016001030120,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "……ありがとうございます",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701600103/7016001030120"
  },
  {
    "id": 7016001030130,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "……でも、本当はもうわかってるんです\r\n私はアイドルを……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701600103/7016001030130",
    "charAnim3Loop": false
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？　何か言ったか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7016001030140,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "いえ、なんでもありません",
